Iteraror 

This is a built in design pattern in java 
This tell simply not to expose the internal structure of any collection(list, tree etc) 
We should never tell a client to use for loop to traverse the collection, rather it should be through an iterator. 
There are 2 methods in iterator – hasNext and next 
There are 4 part in a iterator  

    Iterartor interface  
    Concrete Iterator 
    Aggregate interface  - StudentCollection
    Concrete Aggregate   - StudentRepo

Flow
 
 Client -> StudentReo(Internally StudentCollection) -> CreateIteraor -> StudentIterator -> use methodw